    <description>Z3 4.12.2 AnyCPU managed binding and per-RID native libraries used by the V# compiler. The binaries are the official Z3 4.12.2 release (MIT, copyright Microsoft Corporation); linux-arm64 and win-arm64 are built from that tag because the release has no official archive for them. This package is produced by build/fetch-z3.sh and is not published.</description>
